# Dependencies
node_modules/
.env

# Reports
reports/
allure-results/
allure-report/
local.log
# Console logs and page snapshots the Playwright test MCP server drops as the
# agents explore. Working material for one run, never worth a commit.
.playwright-mcp/

# Claude Code
# Contents, not the directory itself: git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so `.claude/` would make the negation below unreachable.
.claude/*
# The Playwright agent definitions are a deliverable, not local configuration:
# they are what teaches an agent this framework's architecture, so they ship.
!.claude/agents/
# The OpenSpec skills are generated by `openspec update`, and this repository
# edits them to call the Playwright agents from inside the spec-driven flow.
# Tracking them is what makes those edits visible in a pull request diff, and
# what tells us an upgrade has overwritten them.
!.claude/skills/
